sts to that file will be handled by the cache web proxy server instead of the main server hosting the files. The cache web proxy server fetches the files from the main server until its buffer runs out. The server then deletes the files to make space for the new files.","topics":[],"score":1971,"global_rank":318186},{"name":"SamKustin/dotfiles","owner":"SamKustin","html_url":"https://github.com/SamKustin/dotfiles","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Vim script","description":"My vim, zsh, and prezto dotfiles","topics":[],"score":1971,"global_rank":318187},{"name":"thipokch/INFO449-SimpleCalciOS","owner":"thipokch","html_url":"https://github.com/thipokch/INFO449-SimpleCalciOS","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Swift","description":null,"topics":[],"score":1971,"global_rank":318190},{"name":"thipokch/INFO449-iOS-DomainModel","owner":"thipokch","html_url":"https://github.com/thipokch/INFO449-iOS-DomainModel","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Swift","description":null,"topics":[],"score":1971,"global_rank":318191},{"name":"ashwinkalyan/Karnatic-Music-Transcription","owner":"ashwinkalyan","html_url":"https://github.com/ashwinkalyan/Karnatic-Music-Transcription","stars":0,"forks":1,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Matlab","description":null,"topics":[],"score":1971,"global_rank":318192},{"name":"chen0040/ansible-spring-with-nginx","owner":"chen0040","html_url":"https://github.com/chen0040/ansible-spring-with-nginx","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Shell","description":"Sample project showing how to use ansible to configure nginx to serve as reverse proxy for spring application","topics":["ansible","nginx","spring-boot","ssl"],"score":1971,"global_rank":318211},{"name":"chen0040/vagrant-zookeeper-cluster","owner":"chen0040","html_url":"https://github.com/chen0040/vagrant-zookeeper-cluster","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Roff","description":"Vagrantfile for sett